#: ../../using/configure.rst:1573
msgid "Default: ``$(PY_STDMODULE_CFLAGS) -DPy_BUILD_CORE_BUILTIN``."
msgstr "デフォルト: ``$(PY_STDMODULE_CFLAGS) -DPy_BUILD_CORE_BUILTIN``。"

